hadiths[19]{hadithnumber,text}:
"171","[AI-translation] Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Yahud mein jab koi aurat haiza hoti, to us ko na apne saath khilatay, na ghar mein us ke saath rehtay. Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke ashaab ne Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se is ke mutaliq poocha to Allah Taala ne ye aayat utari: Poochtay hain tum se haiz ke baaray mein, tum keh do ke haiz paleedi hai, to juda raho auraton se haiz ki haalat mein, aayat. Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke sab kaam karo siwa jima ke. Ye khabar Yahud ko pahunchi, to unhon ne kaha ke ye shakhs, yani Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam), chahta hai ke har baat mein hamaray khilaf karay. Ye sun kar Usaid bin Huzair (raziyallahu anhu) aur Ubad bin Bishr (raziyallahu anhu) aaye aur arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Yahud aisa aisa kehtay hain to ham haiza auraton se jima kyun na karein, yani jab Yahud hamari mukhalifat ko bura jantay hain aur is se jaltay hain to hamein bhi achi tarah khilaf karna chahiye. Ye suntay hi Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke chehray ka rang badal gaya. Un ke ye kehnay se ham jima kyun na karein Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko bura maloom hua is liye ke khilaf-e-Quran baat hai. Ham ye samjhay ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko in donon shakhson par ghussa aaya hai. Wo uth kar bahar niklay, itnay mein kisi ne Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko doodh tohfa ke taur par bheja, to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne in donon ko phir bula bheja aur doodh pilaya tab un ko maloom hua ke Aap ka ghussa un par na tha. (Muslim). Baab: Aurat ke ghusl-e-haiz aur janabat ki sifat."
"172","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Shakl ki beti ya Yazid bin Sakan ki beti Asma (raziyallahu anha) ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se ghusl-e-haiz ke mutaliq poocha? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke pehle pani bairi ke patton ke saath le aur us se achi tarah paaki karay, yani haiz ka khoon jo laga hua ho, dhoye aur saaf karay. Phir sar par pani daal kar khoob zor se malay, yahan tak ke pani maangon, baalon ki jaron, mein pahunch jaye. Phir apne upar pani daalay, yani saaray badan par. Phir aik phaha, roi ya kapray ka, mushk laga hua le kar us se paaki karay. Asma (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke main kaisay pakeezgi hasil karun? To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: SubhanAllah pakeezgi hasil kar le gi. To Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne chupkay se keh diya ke khoon ke maqam par laga de. Phir us ne ghusl-e-janabat ke mutaliq poocha to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke pani le kar achi tarah taharat karay, phir sar par pani daalay aur malay, yahan tak ke pani sab maangon mein pahunch jaye, phir apne saaray badan par pani daalay. Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke Ansaar ki aurtein bhi kya achi aurtein thin ke deen ki baat poochnay mein sharam nahi karti thin. Aur yehi lazim hai kyunke sharam gunah aur masiyat mein hai aur deen ki baat poochna sawab aur ajar hai. (Muslim). (Firsa se murad roi ya kapray ka tukra hai; Aisha ne aahista kaha jo mukhatib sunay.)"
"173","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) masjid mein thay ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se farmaya: Mujhe kapra utha de. Unhon ne kaha ke main to haiza hun. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke tera haiz tere haath mein nahi hai. Phir unhon ne kapra utha diya. (Muslim: 1/168). Baab: Haiza ka kanghi karna aur mard ka sar dhona."
"174","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main, jab etikaf mein hoti, haajat ke liye ghar mein jati aur chaltay chaltay jo koi ghar mein beemar hota to us ko bhi pooch leti aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) masjid mein reh kar apna sar meri taraf daal detay aur main us mein kanghi kar deti aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab etikaf mein hotay to ghar mein na jatay magar haajat ke liye. (Muslim: 1/167). Baab: Haiza ki god mein tek lagana aur Quran padhna."
"175","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) meri god mein takiya lagatay aur Quran padhtay thay jabke main haiza hoti thi. (Muslim: 1/169). Baab: Haiza ke saath lihaaf mein sona."
"176","[AI-translation] Umm Salama (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath chaadar mein laiti hui thi ke achanak main haiza ho gayi. Main khisak gayi aur apne haiz ke kapray utha liye. Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke kya tujhe haiz aaya? Main ne kaha ke haan. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujhe bulaya, phir main Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath usi chaadar mein laiti. Rawi-e-hadees Zainab ne kaha ke Umm Salama (raziyallahu anha) aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) donon aik hi bartan se ghusl-e-janabat kiya kartay thay. (Muslim: 1/167). Baab: Haiza se tehband ke upar mubashirat. (Kunta ka lafz Muslim mein nahi; khameela se murad qateefa hai; insilaal se murad chhup kar jana hai.)"
"177","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham mein se jab kisi aurat ko haiz aata to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) haiz ke khoon ke josh ke dauran tehband baandhnay ka hukm kartay, phir us se mubashirat kartay, yani biwi ke saath so jatay. Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke tum mein se kaun apni khwahish aur zaroorat par is qadar ikhtiyar rakhta hai jaisa Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) rakhtay thay. (Muslim). (Mubashirat se murad yahan farj ke bahar milna hai, izaar ki wajah se; baaz ne isay mauzoo kaha jo ghalat hai.)"
"178","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main pani peeti thi, phir pee kar bartan Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko deti, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) usi jagah munh rakhtay jahan main ne munh rakh kar piya tha aur pani peetay, halanke main haiza hoti aur main haddi noochti, phir Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko de deti, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) usi jagah munh lagatay jahan main ne lagaya tha. (Muslim: 1/168). Baab: Mustahaza aur us ki namaz. (Araq se murad haddi se gosht nochna hai.)"
"179","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Umm Habiba bint Jahsh (raziyallahu anha) ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se poocha ke mujhe istihaza hai to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke ye khoon aik rag ka hai to ghusl kar aur namaz padh. Phir wo har namaz ke liye ghusl karti thin. Lais ne kaha ke Ibn Shihab ne ye nahi bayan kiya ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un ko har namaz ke liye ghusl karnay ka hukm kiya tha balke Umm Habiba (raziyallahu anha) ne khud aisa kiya. (Muslim: 1/181). Baab: Haiza namaz ki qaza nahi karti, rozay ki karti hai."
"180","[AI-translation] Muaza (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke main ne Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se poocha ke kya wajah hai ke haiza aurat rozon ki qaza karti hai aur namaz ki qaza nahi karti? To unhon ne kaha ke tu Harooriya to nahi? Main ne kaha ke nahi main to poochti hun. Unhon ne kaha ke ham auraton ko haiz aata tha to rozon ki qaza ka hukm hota tha aur namaz ki qaza ka hukm nahi diya jata tha. Kitna umda jawab diya ke deen to Allah aur Rasool ke hukm ka naam hai jis ka hukm diya, kar liya aur jis ka hukm nahi diya, nahi kiya. (Muslim: 1/182). Baab: Fitrat ki paanch cheezein. (Harooriya Khawarij ka giroh hai jo haiza par namaz ki qaza wajib kehtay hain.)"
"181","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Fitrat paanch hain ya paanch cheezein fitrat se hain. 1. Khatna karna. 2. Zair-e-naaf baal mondna. 3. Nakhun kaatna. 4. Baghal ke baal ukhairna. 5. Moonchhein katrana, katrana. (Muslim)"
"182","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Das baatein paidaishi sunnat hain. 1: Moonchhein katarna. 2: Daarhi chhor dena. 3: Miswaak karna. 4: Naak mein pani daalna. 5: Nakhun kaatna. 6: Poron ka dhona, kaanon ke andar aur naak aur baghal aur raanon ka dhona. 7: Baghal ke baal ukhairna. 8: Zair-e-naaf baal lena. 9: Pani se istinja karna, ya sharmgah par wuzu ke baad thora sa pani chhirak lena. Musab ne kaha ke main daswin baat bhool gaya. Shayad kulli karna ho. Waki ne kaha: Intiqaas-ul-maa, jo hadees mein waarid hai, us se istinja murad hai. (Muslim: 1/153). Baab: Baray ko miswaak dena."
"183","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke main ne apne aap ko khwab mein miswaak kartay dekha. Phir wo miswaak mujh se do aadmiyon ne maanga, un donon mein se aik bara tha. Main ne miswaak chotay ko de di, to mujhe hukm hua ke baray ko dein, to main ne baray ko de di. (Muslim: 7/57). Baab: Moonchhein katrao aur daarhiyan barhao."
"184","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tamam aqwaal o afaal mein mushrikon ke khilaf karo: Moonchhon ko katrao aur daarhiyon ko poora rakho, yani daarhiyon ko chhor do aur un mein kaant chhaant na karo. (Muslim: 1/153)"
"185","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke hamaray liye moonch katar-nay, nakhun kaatnay, baghal ke baal noochnay aur zair-e-naaf baal mondnay ki meeaad muqarrar hui ke un ko chaalees din se zyada tak na chhorein. (Muslim: 1/153). Baab: Masjid mein peshaab ka dhona."
"186","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke ham Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath masjid mein baithay hue thay ke itnay mein aik airaabi aaya aur kharay ho kar peshaab karnay laga. Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke ashaab ne usay aisa na karnay ke liye aawaz lagayi to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke us ka peshaab mat roko, us ko chhor do. Logon ne chhor diya, yahan tak ke wo peshaab kar chuka to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne usay bulaya aur farmaya ke masjidein peshaab aur nijasat ke laiq nahi hain. Ye to Allah ki yaad ke liye aur namaz aur Quran padhnay ke liye banayi gayi hain ya aisa hi kuch Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya. Phir aik shakhs ko hukm kiya, wo aik dole pani ka laya aur us par baha diya. (Muslim). (Mah mah se murad ruko hai; hadeed se murad ustra hai; aana se murad sharmgah ke baal hain.)"
"187","[AI-translation] Umm Qais (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke wo Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas apne aik bachay ko le kar aayein jo khana nahi khata tha. Ubaidullah, rawi-e-hadees, ne kaha ke Umm Qais (raziyallahu anha) ne khabar di ke us bachay ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki god mein peshaab kar diya to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne pani mangwaya aur kapray par chhirak liya aur us ko dhoya nahi. (Muslim: 1/164). Baab: Kapray se mani ka dhona."
"188","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Shihab Khaulani bayan kartay hain ke main Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ke han mehmaan thehra. Mujhe apne kapron mein ehtelam ho gaya, to main ne un ko pani mein dubo diya. Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ki londi ne mujhe dekh liya, to us ne unhein ja kar bataya. Aisha ne meri taraf paigham bheja ke tum ne aisa kyun kiya hai? Main ne kaha ke khwab mein main ne wo dekha hai jo sonay wala dekhta hai, yani ehtelam. Aisha ne kaha ke kapron mein tum ne, mani ka, kuch asar dekha? Main ne kaha nahi. Unhon ne farmaya ke agar kapron mein tu kuch dekhta to bhi us ka dhona hi kaafi tha. Main to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke kapray se khushk mani ko apne nakhunon se khurch diya karti thi. (Muslim: 1/165). Baab: Haiz ke khoon ka kapray se dhona."
"189","[AI-translation] Asma bint Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Aik aurat Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aayi aur us ne poocha ke ham mein se kisi ke kapray mein haiz ka khoon lag jaye to wo kya karay? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke pehle us ko khurch daalay, phir pani daal kar mal kar dho daalay aur phir usi kapray mein namaz padh le. (Muslim: 1/166). (Dauhu se murad chhor do hai; nazh se murad chhirakna hai; qars se murad ungliyon se malna hai.)"
